@layout "layout.nview"

@section "content"

<div class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">{{ subjudul }}</p>
    <span class="version-pill">{{ badge }}</span>
</div>

<div class="prose">
    <p>LarapakGo hadir dengan arsitektur <strong>100% Go Standard Library</strong> tanpa dependensi eksternal, tanpa runtime Python maupun Node.js. Pilih platform sistem operasi Anda pada tab di bawah ini untuk mengunduh paket resmi:</p>

    <style>
        l-tab-panel:not(:first-of-type) {
            display: none;
        }
        .download-tab-container {
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        .platform-tab-content {
            padding-top: 0.5rem;
        }
        .platform-desc-lead {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-dim, #a1a1aa);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
    </style>

    <!-- Model Tab Pusat Unduhan -->
    <div class="download-tab-container">
        <l-tabs>
            <!-- TAB 1: WINDOWS -->
            <l-tab-panel header="Windows (.exe)">
                <div class="platform-tab-content">
                    <p class="platform-desc-lead">Paket rilis resmi untuk sistem operasi Microsoft Windows 10, Windows 11, dan Windows Server (64-bit AMD64).</p>

                    <div class="download-featured-grid">
                        <!-- Setup Installer -->
                        <div class="download-box download-box-highlight">
                            <div class="download-box-badge">Rekomendasi Desktop</div>
                            <div class="download-box-header">
                                <div class="download-icon-circle">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path d="M0 3.449L9.75 2.1v9.451H0m10.949-9.602L24 0v11.4H10.949M0 12.6h9.75v9.451L0 20.699M10.949 12.6H24V24l-12.901-1.799"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="download-box-title">LarapakGo Setup Installer (.exe)</h3>
                                    <p class="download-box-sub">Pemasang wizard grafis resmi untuk Windows</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <ul class="download-feature-list">
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Pendaftaran otomatis ke variabel sistem <code>PATH</code> (langsung kenal perintah <code>larapak</code>)</span>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Menyertakan uninstaller bersih di Windows Settings &amp; Control Panel</span>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Ukuran berkas kompak: <strong>5.74 MB</strong></span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="download-box-actions">
                                <a href="/unduh/setup" class="btn-download-primary" title="Unduh LarapakGo Setup Installer Windows">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                                        <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
                                        <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
                                    </svg>
                                    <span>Unduh Setup Installer (.exe) - 5.7 MB</span>
                                </a>
                                <a href="https://github.com/IlhamHattaManggala/LarapakGo/raw/main/dist/LarapakGo-Setup-v1.0.0.exe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-download-sublink">
                                    Mirror Tautan GitHub
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Standalone Portable Binary .exe -->
                        <div class="download-box">
                            <div class="download-box-badge badge-neutral">Portabel / Standalone</div>
                            <div class="download-box-header">
                                <div class="download-icon-circle icon-circle-neutral">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline>
                                        <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"></line>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="download-box-title">LarapakGo Standalone CLI (.exe)</h3>
                                    <p class="download-box-sub">Biner tunggal portabel tanpa wizard instalasi</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <ul class="download-feature-list">
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Single executable mandiri: cukup letakkan di folder kerja atau direktori PATH</span>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Ideal untuk script automated CI/CD, USB drive portabel, atau server</span>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Ukuran berkas: <strong>10.5 MB</strong></span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="download-box-actions">
                                <a href="/unduh/windows" class="btn-download-secondary" title="Unduh LarapakGo Standalone Binary Windows">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                                        <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
                                        <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
                                    </svg>
                                    <span>Unduh Standalone .exe - 10.5 MB</span>
                                </a>
                                <a href="https://github.com/IlhamHattaManggala/LarapakGo/raw/main/dist/larapak-v1.0.0-windows-amd64.exe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-download-sublink">
                                    Mirror Tautan GitHub
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </l-tab-panel>

            <!-- TAB 2: LINUX -->
            <l-tab-panel header="Linux">
                <div class="platform-tab-content">
                    <p class="platform-desc-lead">Biner mandiri native untuk distribusi Linux x86_64 / AMD64 (Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, Arch, CentOS, Alpine, dll).</p>

                    <div class="download-featured-grid">
                        <div class="download-box">
                            <div class="download-box-badge badge-neutral">Biner Mandiri Linux</div>
                            <div class="download-box-header">
                                <div class="download-icon-circle">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                                        <rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                                        <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"></line>
                                        <line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"></line>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="download-box-title">LarapakGo Linux (AMD64)</h3>
                                    <p class="download-box-sub">Biner 64-bit mandiri terkompilasi statis (10.2 MB)</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <ul class="download-feature-list">
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Tergabung utuh dengan CLI, HTTP Engine, Route Studio, dan Compiler</span>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                                    <span>Tanpa shared library glibc khusus, kompatibel dengan container Alpine</span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="download-box-actions">
                                <a href="/unduh/linux" class="btn-download-primary" title="Unduh Biner Mandiri Linux">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                                        <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
                                        <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
                                    </svg>
                                    <span>Unduh Biner Linux (10.2 MB)</span>
                                </a>
                                <a href="https://github.com/IlhamHattaManggala/LarapakGo/raw/main/dist/larapak-v1.0.0-linux-amd64" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-download-sublink">
                                    Mirror Tautan GitHub
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="download-box">
                            <div class="download-box-badge badge-neutral">Instalasi Otomatis CLI</div>
                            <h3 class="download-box-title" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Instalasi 1 Baris (Terminal)</h3>
                            <p class="download-box-sub" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Jalankan perintah ini di terminal Linux untuk mengunduh dan memasang langsung ke <code>/usr/local/bin/larapak</code>:</p>

                            <pre style="margin-bottom: 1rem;"><code>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IlhamHattaManggala/LarapakGo/main/install.sh | bash</code></pre>

                            <p class="download-box-sub">Atau pasang manual biner yang diunduh:</p>
                            <pre><code>chmod +x larapak-v1.0.0-linux-amd64
sudo mv larapak-v1.0.0-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/larapak</code></pre>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </l-tab-panel>

            <!-- TAB 3: MACOS -->
            <l-tab-panel header="macOS">
                <div class="platform-tab-content">
                    <p class="platform-desc-lead">Biner mandiri native yang dioptimalkan untuk arsitektur Apple Silicon ARM64 (M1, M2, M3, M4).</p>

                    <div class="download-featured-grid">
                        <div class="download-box">
