                                <a href="https://github.com/IlhamHattaManggala/LarapakGo/raw/main/dist/larapak-v1.0.0-darwin-arm64" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-download-sublink">
                                    Mirror Tautan GitHub
